          "normalized_text": "According to the Ministry of Defence, GSAT-7C is intended for the Indian Air Force. The Ministry of Defence reported that GSAT-7C supports secure communications for Air Force assets. The Ministry of Defence described GSAT-7C as indigenously designed and manufactured. According to the Ministry of Defence, Varunastra is an indigenous ship-launched anti-submarine torpedo. The Ministry of Defence reported that Varunastra was developed by Naval Science and Technological Laboratory. The Ministry of Defence stated that Varunastra enhances the Indian Navy anti-submarine capability.",
